{"unit_id":"tag:0ADT:proof","translation":"我们来构造从右到左的函子（functor）。令<MATH_0001>为层（sheaves）的映射（map），这些层在<MATH_0002>上，且每个<MATH_0003>都是代数空间（algebraic space）。我们有投影<MATH_0004>。于是<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>都表示层（sheaf）<MATH_0007>，从而得到同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0008>\n容易看出，映射（maps）<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>上的态射（morphisms），并满足余循环条件（cocycle condition）。从右到左的函子（functor）由这一构造<MATH_0011>给出。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n我们来构造从左到右的函子（functor）。同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0012>给出同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0013>\n在<MATH_0014>上。令<MATH_0015>等于下列图（diagram）中的余等化子（coequalizer）\n<MATH_0016>\n余循环条件（cocycle condition）保证<MATH_0017>带有映射（map）<MATH_0018>，且<MATH_0019>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0020>。从左到右的函子（functor）由这一构造<MATH_0021>给出。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n我们省略这些构造是互为拟逆（quasi-inverse）的函子（functors）的验证。最后的陈述(1)和(2)由这些构造得到。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"余循环条件"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"isomorphisms","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"cocycle condition","target_term":"余循环条件"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"两个方向的构造；待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"映射对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"map","t